ion, what Hollywood gets wrong about archaeology in movies such as Indiana Jones and Tomb Raider. Did you know that in World War I, archaeologists were spies? Laurie learned many interesting","photo":"data:image/png;base64,","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]},{"name":"Tour Guide","desc":null,"photo":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":4}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","cover":"https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/628ea3e3ee1c774c684e7c3d1814529d/ncvm-galleryL-1-min.jpg","photos":["https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/628ea3e3ee1c774c684e7c3d1814529d/ncvm-galleryL-1-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/16d12e03d1603b6316ba2941177fba26/ncvm-galleryL-2-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/99fc138aa67195147f4b22345e96cf7e/ncvm-galleryL-7-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/0f3a2b1bed6ddcc5684484c973a8cccb/ncvm-galleryL-8-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/c3d3ab827d9d73f1cbb2a6c5ba3cbb99/ncvm-galleryL-10-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/f73ea33525c0bd111c3522b7d11be842/ncvm-galleryP-2-min.jpg","https://nosecreekvalleymuseum.com/static/f009235b111cdc585dddbc0981d07cd6/ncvm-galleryP-3-min.jpg"],"ytVideos":[],"lat":51.2777667,"lon":-114.0140828,"tags":["View Exhibits","Facility Rentals","Tour Guide","Class"],"highlights":[],"requirements":[],"groupInfo":[],"bring":[],"policies":[],"hoursText":["Mon 10:00 AM - 4:00 PM","Tue 10:00 AM - 4:00 PM","Wed 10:00 AM - 4:00 PM","Thu 3:00 PM - 8:00 PM","Fri Closed","Sat Closed"],"faq":[],"quotes":[],"promos":[],"contact":{"domain":"nosecreekvalleymuseum.com","phone":null,"street":"1701 Main Street SW","city":"Airdrie","region":"AB","postal":"T4B 1C5","hours":[]}}